From: Kyle Havlovitz <kylehav@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:05:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Fix match termination timing and freeze completed games

Resolve stock elimination after all fighters complete the frame, and stop subsequent stepping after elimination or the existing max_frame cutoff. Store that cutoff with native match state so copy and restore preserve it.

(cherry picked from upstream commit fcc4646440df10f5a58452ec3c3a86c341af1b18 onto visual-only/04-shake)

Combined with this branch: msl_batch_destroy keeps this branch's game-data release; the outcome is resolved before the viewer track's frame record.

